# Bankrupt in Blood: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice two creatures" (CR 118.8, 601.2b-h). The cost
# can only be paid with creatures its caster controls, so it is not castable with one creature of its own - a noncreature
# Mox and an opponent's creature do not count - and is castable the moment a second creature of its own arrives
# (the positive control, on turn 3). The opponent's Ornithopter is never offered for the sacrifice and stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Bankrupt in Blood
Swamp x3
Ornithopter
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Bankrupt in Blood.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Bankrupt in Blood.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Bankrupt in Blood.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Bankrupt in Blood; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Ornithopter
